    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d252">

                <pb facs="0325" n="307" xml:id="pg307"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">810.20 Defense/8–1546</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the British
                        Ambassador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Inverchapel</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1946-08-26">August 26, 1946</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Ambassador</hi>: In acknowledging your
                    note of August 15,<anchor n="11" xml:id="d252-f1"/> I enclose an <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Aide-Mémoire</hi> bearing on the inquiries that you made
                    of me at our interview on July 18 and set forth in the <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Aide-Mémoire</hi> of July 16 that you left with me at that time.</p>
                <p>I hope this information meets the purpose of your inquiries and will be
                    helpful.</p>
                <p>Sincerely yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dean Acheson</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d252-a1.xml" xpointer="d252-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
